WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.633
Meet brainy storm.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.500
Just start talking.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:07.167
And let every idea find its place.

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:13.000
Memo captures your conversation, while Brainy organizes it into ideas,

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:17.167
each with its own dedicated page. Updated as you go.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.067
Going in circles?

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.500
Storm steps in.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:30.867
Hi team! It seems like we have been discussing latency for quite some time. Let’s try to move forward.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.200
Meanwhile, your agent research team gets to work.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:36.600
Weighing trade-offs,

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.533
proposing the system architecture,

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.200
and searching for competitors.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.533
Finn pulls together the conclusions.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.033
And Jayson packages the context for export.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:54.967
Hand it to your coding agent and start building with the reasoning already there.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:58.167
Eight agents, one conversation.

00:00:58.233 --> 00:01:01.367
Make brainstorming productive.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.033
With brainy storm.
